# Agent Bootstrap

Before doing ANY exploration or code changes, read `.cursor/reference.md` first. It contains the full codebase map: directory structure, every package export, design system tokens, component patterns, and how-to guides.

This saves you from wasting turns on `find`, `grep`, or reading index files. The reference has it all.

After reading, also check:

- `CLAUDE.md` for project rules (annotation headers, conventions)
- `.cursor/agents/` for any agent-specific instructions relevant to your task
- `.cursor/plans/` for prior design reviews and thinking logs
